nst an unreadable lock both refuse with environment_store_untrusted and rebuild nothing (rebuilt) and write nothing (written), repair emitting no fragment; restore restores the newest backup generation (env unmanage --restore-backups, section 9.2) and stops before mutating (written) when the generations inventory cannot be established. The backup-record class covers the generations inventory: an unreadable inventory is environment_backup_record_unreadable with currency unknown, while a known-empty inventory is current with currency known.",
